  "instructions": [
    "Heat 1 tablespoon of vegetable oil in a wok over medium-high heat.",
    "Add the Sichuan peppercorns and cook for 1-2 minutes, until fragrant.",
    "Add the grated ginger and cook for 1 minute, until slightly caramelized.",
    "Add the minced garlic and cook for 30 seconds, until fragrant.",
    "Add the fermented soybean paste, chili bean paste, sugar, salt, and white pepper. Stir-fry for 2-3 minutes, until the paste is fragrant.",
    "Add the savoiardi-ladyfingers and toss them in the sauce for 2-3 minutes, until well coated.",
    "Transfer the ladyfingers to a lazy-susan-spinner and garnish with chopped green onions.",
    "Serve immediately, garnished with additional green onions if desired."
